{
  "source": "Prompts/document-trap-6.mp4",
  "duration": 197.48575,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.58,
      "text": "Your season-end basketball tournament starts next week, so you want to brush up on the rules."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.36,
      "end": 8.9,
      "text": "You upload your league's 200-page rulebook to check a specific detail."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.7,
      "end": 12.88,
      "text": "You ask the AI, how many fouls until I'm out of the game?"
    },
    {
      "start": 13.56,
      "end": 16.26,
      "text": "It answers instantly. Five fouls, and you foul out."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.06,
      "end": 17.54,
      "text": "Wait a second."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.1,
      "end": 23.44,
      "text": "In last year's tournament, you remember a player on the opposing team picking up five fouls and staying right on the court,"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.0,
      "end": 25.48,
      "text": "so you dig through the rulebook yourself."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.48,
      "end": 29.72,
      "text": "The regular season limit is five fouls, exactly what the AI stated."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.28,
      "end": 33.62,
      "text": "But near the end, there's a special tournament section where players get six."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.38,
      "end": 37.3,
      "text": "The AI pulled the standard limit, missing the exception completely."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.0,
      "end": 39.86,
      "text": "Its answer wasn't made up, just incomplete."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.82,
      "end": 41.98,
      "text": "This is the document trap."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.58,
      "end": 48.34,
      "text": "We assume that because a file is uploaded, the AI has fully read and comprehended every single word inside it."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.78,
      "end": 52.52,
      "text": "An AI can only answer based on the text that fits inside its context window."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.52,
      "end": 54.72,
      "text": "A short file might drop in perfectly."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.76,
      "end": 61.2,
      "text": "But with a long file, the system has to filter the text and search for the parts that seem most relevant."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.92,
      "end": 65.74,
      "text": "To pull this off, the AI relies on a specific three-step process."
    },
    {
      "start": 66.36,
      "end": 67.18,
      "text": "This breaks down the workflow."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.24,
      "end": 70.94,
      "text": "First is split, breaking your document into smaller pieces."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.88,
      "end": 75.74,
      "text": "Second is search, finding pieces matching your question based on keywords and meaning."
    },
    {
      "start": 76.7,
      "end": 79.82,
      "text": "Third is load, putting selected pieces into the context window."
    },
    {
      "start": 80.42,
      "end": 84.2,
      "text": "Search acts as a strict gatekeeper, deciding which parts reach the answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 84.86,
      "end": 86.96,
      "text": "This is exactly how the rulebook mistake happens."
    },
    {
      "start": 87.56,
      "end": 92.1,
      "text": "The search function finds the regular season foul limit, but it entirely misses the tournament exception."
    },
    {
      "start": 92.84,
      "end": 97.6,
      "text": "Only the selected piece containing the five foul rule passes through the filter and reaches the context window."
    },
    {
      "start": 98.3,
      "end": 99.84,
      "text": "There is a formal name for what just happened."
    },
    {
      "start": 100.5,
      "end": 102.58,
      "text": "Retrieval, Augmented Generation, or RAG."
    },
    {
      "start": 102.96,
      "end": 107.98,
      "text": "The exact same mechanism is used any time an AI pulls information from a large database or the open web."
    },
    {
      "start": 107.98,
      "end": 114.18,
      "text": "When retrieval misses a critical condition or exception, the OI lacks the context to answer accurately."
    },
    {
      "start": 114.94,
      "end": 118.4,
      "text": "It provides a confident, detailed response that is factually incomplete."
    },
    {
      "start": 119.5,
      "end": 122.16,
      "text": "Guide the AI's retrieval with four precise moves."
    },
    {
      "start": 123.34,
      "end": 125.84,
      "text": "First, name the section using exact headings."
    },
    {
      "start": 126.82,
      "end": 130.0,
      "text": "Second, ask one thing, giving retrieval a single target."
    },
    {
      "start": 131.02,
      "end": 135.96,
      "text": "Third, share what matters by manually pasting relevant passages directly into your prompt."
    },
    {
      "start": 135.96,
      "end": 140.86,
      "text": "Fourth, ask for the quote to compare its answer against the original text."
    },
    {
      "start": 141.68,
      "end": 147.84,
      "text": "Applying these moves takes you from hoping the AI finds the right answer to actively engineering a precise retrieval."
    },
    {
      "start": 148.86,
      "end": 150.54,
      "text": "Let's apply those moves to the rulebook."
    },
    {
      "start": 151.16,
      "end": 153.04,
      "text": "We ask, look in the tournament section."
    },
    {
      "start": 153.66,
      "end": 155.12,
      "text": "How many personal fouls are allowed?"
    },
    {
      "start": 155.8,
      "end": 157.12,
      "text": "Quote the rule and any exceptions."
    },
    {
      "start": 158.14,
      "end": 163.44,
      "text": "The AI successfully navigates to the specific tournament section and outputs the correct sexile limit."
    },
    {
      "start": 164.02,
      "end": 170.34,
      "text": "Generating that quotation is useful because it allows you to check the AI's work, not because the AI generated it."
    },
    {
      "start": 170.86,
      "end": 173.68,
      "text": "This trap stretches far beyond a basketball court."
    },
    {
      "start": 174.28,
      "end": 180.42,
      "text": "Apartment leases, employment contracts, and insurance policies all contain conditions that change the final answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 181.18,
      "end": 187.52,
      "text": "Uploading a long document and asking an AI to summarize it is a good starting point, but it is not the end of your process."
    },
    {
      "start": 188.26,
      "end": 191.72,
      "text": "As this graphic states, a missing passage can change the answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 191.72,
      "end": 194.06,
      "text": "Ask for the passage, then check it."
    }
  ],
